      "id": 4322018,
      "name": "[Ju Fufu] Mountain King Banishes Evil - Lv.60",
      "desc": "Ju Fufu's exclusive Tactical Prism.\nAfter opening an Electronic Strongbox, all squad members gain a Shield equal to 15% of their Max HP for 60s. This effect does not stack, and the same Strongbox cannot trigger it more than once.\nAfter Ju Fufu uses <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack: Suppressing Tiger Cauldron</color>, if she is not the active character, she launches one <color=#FFFFFF>Tag Assist</color>, circling the enemy and performing the 4th hit of her <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack</color>. The skill's DMG is considered <color=#2BAD00>Aftershock DMG</color>, and the <color=#2BAD00>DMG dealt increases by 75%</color> and <color=#2BAD00>Daze dealt increases by 45%</color>.",
